      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/mkule/status/1960318743692865829",
      "text": "Only ₱450-million has been allotted to PGH, covering just half of the ₱900-million needed to continue the Multi-Specialty Building. More urgent requests, such as the ₱1.7-billion for personnel and maintenance support and ₱1-billion for fire safety compliance, were excluded. This comes after the hospital endured three fire incidents in 2024 alone. A Manila Collegian report noted that despite a ₱260-million fire suppression allocation in 2025, the hospital merely acquired more extinguishers, leaving the promised suppression system uninstalled.\n\nREAD: https://t.co/bXnf0q4pCb",
